          "comparability": "ASC606 adoption in 2018 is a break; FY2016–2017 is not retrospectively normalized. FY2021–2023 revenue and EBIT are restated continuing operations following Intrinsix disposal, while net income and total CFO are consolidated. Continuing CFO and D&A are separately reconciled; a continuing PPE-capex split is unavailable.",
